  "label": "A perspective that promotes or justifies racial discrimination or hatred",
  "description": "A racist perspective is a perspective that promotes or justifies racial discrimination or hatred. The meme promotes a racist perspective by implying that if the victims are not racially defined (e.g., zombies), then the act of killing them cannot be classified as homicide, thereby normalizing or downplaying racially motivated violence. This requires understanding of the concept of racist perspectives and their role in promoting harmful ideologies.",
